{
  "slug": "wordpress-publisher",
  "name": "Wordpress Publisher",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full WordPress publishing pipeline for Claude Code and Cowork. Deploy posts with JSON-LD schema, optimise images to WebP with SEO metadata, manage Nginx redirects, audit content against 28+ compliance checks, and monitor site health — all from natural language. No WordPress dashboard required. Includes 5 skills: wp-deploy, wp-audit, image-seo, redirect-manager, and site-health.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **1 agent**, **5 commands** and **5 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `image-seo` (Full image SEO pipeline: optimise file size, convert to WebP, upload to WordPress media library, and set all…), `post-audit` (Programmatic compliance audit for WordPress posts), `post-deploy` (Full 8-step WordPress post deployment pipeline), `redirect-manager` (Safely manage Nginx 301 redirects: add, list, verify, and remove redirects without manual config file editing), `site-health` (WordPress site health check covering: plugin status, PHP errors, cache state, SSL validity, broken links, slow pages, and…)\n- **Agents** (1): `full-publish` (Autonomous end-to-end WordPress publishing agent)\n- **Commands** (5): `audit` (Run the 28-check post compliance audit on any WordPress post or HTML file), `deploy` (Deploy a post or page to WordPress), `health` (Run a full WordPress site health check — plugins, PHP errors, cache, SSL, broken links, response time, and…), `image-seo` (Optimise an image, convert to WebP, upload to WordPress, and set all 4 SEO metadata fields (alt text,…), `redirect` (Manage Nginx 301 redirects)\n- **MCP servers** (5): `~~wordpress`, `~~filesystem`, `~~search_console`, `~~browser`, `~~knowledge_base`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wordpress-publisher@claude-community` from `arturseo-geo/cowork-wordpress-publisher`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
